# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local development-assistant workspace
#
# These files exist so the maintainer's local tooling can pick work back up.
# They are working notes and machine configuration, not part of the software:
# nothing here is needed to build, test, run, review or deploy SentinelFlow,
# and a reader looking for how the system works is better served by docs/.
#
# They stay on disk and out of the published repository. Anything in them that
# an external engineer needs was moved into permanent documentation first -
# the coding standards to docs/development/ENGINEERING_STANDARDS.md, the debt
# register to docs/development/KNOWN_ISSUES.md, and the operational lessons to
# the runbooks and troubleshooting guide.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
PROJECT_STATE.md
scripts/claude/
docs/planning/SESSION_LOG.md
docs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
docs/development/CLAUDE_CODE_SETUP.md
